            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yes - I did not know you can pass nil, to save current seesion. That is what I was missing.\r\nI guess it matter of preferences - but I like Startify method - where if you call Startif start screen - it save and close current session, buff delete all, and open new clean startify screen.  But I can recreate this now.   \r\nStill having this as MiniSessions.save_current() would be cool IMO.",
